# Cloudflare Pages and Netlify both honor this format. Workers Static Assets
# honor the copy that lands in /out (see wrangler.jsonc).

# Baseline security headers on every response. HSTS only takes effect over
# HTTPS, so also enable "Always Use HTTPS" in the Cloudflare dashboard so the
# first plain-HTTP hit is redirected. No includeSubDomains/preload on purpose:
# mail/service subdomains (email, autodiscover, _domainconnect) are not served
# here and should not be forced.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN

# OG image routes from app/<route>/opengraph-image.tsx ship without a .png
# extension; force the correct MIME so social scrapers render the card.

/*/opengraph-image
  Content-Type: image/png

/services/*/opengraph-image
  Content-Type: image/png
